      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Middletown%2C_Illinois"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Several hot‑air balloon records were set in Middletown, including a stop by the historic Vin Fiz, the first cross‑country flight.",
